Comment:
 MuiBuilderQt is a from-scratch Qt6/C++ reimplementation (not a byte-for-byte
 port) of Eric Totel's MUI-Builder v2.3, based on its publicly available SVN
 source. No formal license accompanies the original MUI-Builder source, and
 no permission from Eric Totel for this reimplementation has been confirmed.
 See the full LICENSE file (also installed to
 /usr/share/doc/muibuilderqt/LICENSE by this package) for the complete,
 authoritative terms - the License stanza below is a copy of that same text.

